# Scattergun (R8): short, fat and close-range. Double steel barrels over a pump grip, a chunky receiver and a
# brown stock. Rounded parts (cyl beams): a friendly tool. 5 cm voxels like the rifle.
name scattergun
grid 5
size 17 4 6
slot body Ink
slot wood InkBrown
slot steel Steel
box 0 1 1 4 3 4 wood
box 0 1 0 2 3 2 wood
box 3 0 1 9 4 5 body
box 5 1 0 7 3 2 body
beam 9 1 4 16 1 4 1 steel
beam 9 2 4 16 2 4 1 steel
box 9 0 2 13 4 4 wood
box 15 0 3 16 4 5 steel
box 4 1 5 6 3 6 steel
pivot 6 2 2
